  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.3: aligned with Caveman core 1.4.3 (now referenced as a NuGet dependency instead of a project reference; 1.4.3 is a corrective re-publish of 1.4.2, which was missing several 1.4.x features). compress/compress_batch/summarize already supported the 1.4.1 statistical/syntactic levels; summarize gains a topicAware option (segments text into topics first, allocates the sentence budget proportionally). Three new tools: retrieve (BM25+ ranking over text chunks, optional RM3 pseudo-relevance feedback), skeletonize_code (strips comments and collapses function bodies to signatures), near_duplicate (SimHash-based near-duplicate detection for templated/near-identical text).",
